abstract: >-
  A collection of 91 Arabic/RTL LaTeX templates organized into 10 categories
  (academic, business, legal, project management, finance, presentations,
  letters, marketing, personal, technical). All templates use XeLaTeX with
  the Amiri font and polyglossia/bidi for full right-to-left typesetting.
